# Run with TURNSTONE_GENET_ENGINE=bole to route the live document through Bole.
settle 20
key escape
open ${WOODSHED_PIANO_URL}
settle 45
act Open node in Workbench
settle 30
assert wb-cells == 1
assert wb-cell Window Seat
act Maximize pane
settle 30
assert maximized
assert snap browser-current-engine == genet.scripted
assert snap browser-current-content == live

# Client pixels in the 1024x600 native scenario window.
click-at 205 342
click-at 90 282
settle 5
click-at 90 402
settle 3
click-at 490 342
settle 1
click-at 225 402
click-at 280 462
insert Keep the left hand light on the repeat.
settle 20
capture 00_piano_phrase
click-at 140 522
settle 35
log Chose two bar cues and marked the piano phrase through the live Genet Bole page.
